OL,3,GNEWSALibrary books overdue by 116 years
OL,4,Areturned in 'excellent condition'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has returned his late
OL,7,Fgrandfather's library books which were
OL,8,Foverdue by 116 years.
OL,10,FPeter O'Sullivan's grandfather, Walter
OL,11,FGriffith Owen, took out Milton's
OL,12,FParadise Lost and Shakespeare's King
OL,13,FLear in 1910.
OL,15,FA note inside showed they came from
OL,16,Fformer Llanrwst Reading Room & Library
OL,17,Fin Conwy county, and were originally
OL,18,F"lent for one week".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
