OL,3,GNEWSALibrary books overdue by 116 years
OL,4,Areturned in 'excellent condition'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe note continued that should a book
OL,7,F"be required for a second week,
OL,8,Fapplication should be made to the
OL,9,Fcaretaker. Fee, one penny per week".
